  "advertText": null,
  "attentionGrabber": "£35 TAX | 61 MPG | M SPORT |",
  "description": "BMW 320d 2.0 diesel finished in metallic Estoril blue with 116,911 miles, is now available at SRE Motors. The vehicle is in great condition and has been well maintained by the previous owner. The vehicle has had a full vehicle inspection, it will also come with a 9 month minimum MOT, 3 months warranty and 12 months breakdown cover.\n\nThis 2013 BMW 3 Series 320d M Sport is finished in Estoril Blue and comes equipped with a 2.0 litre diesel engine. The vehicle is currently roadworthy with an MOT valid until February 2027. Inside, the cabin features enhanced Bluetooth telephone preparation with a USB audio interface, allowing for seamless connectivity, alongside a DAB digital radio for entertainment. Practicality is supported by 60-40 split folding rear seats, and parking is made easier with front and rear park distance control, which includes both front and rear parking sensors.  This model stands out for its efficiency and utility, offering a fuel economy of 61 mpg and low CO2 emissions, which helps to reduce running costs. The vehicle also provides a large boot space, making it a practical choice for those who require extra room for luggage or equipment. By combining these economical performance figures with versatile storage options and modern convenience features, this BMW 3 Series offers a balanced driving experience suitable for a variety of needs.\n\nContact us today to arrange a viewing, arrange finance, reserve this vehicle or for anymore information We offer low rate finance, nationwide delivery, extended warranty and accept part exchange.",
